OL,3,GNEWSABlue plaque in honour of Mott the
OL,4,AHoople singer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA blue plaque has been installed at the
OL,7,Fhouse where Mott the Hoople lead singer
OL,8,FIan Hunter was born in Oswestry.
OL,10,FThe plaque was unveiled on York Street
OL,11,Fon Saturday by the town's mayor,
OL,12,Fcouncillor Jonathan Upton, and Hunter's
OL,13,Feldest grandson, Jay Patterson.
OL,15,FIn a video message shared by the town
OL,16,Fcouncil, Hunter, who now lives in
OL,17,FConnecticut in the US and was unable to
OL,18,Fattend the unveiling in person, thanked
OL,19,Fthe organisers and said it was a
OL,20,F"surprise and an honour".
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
