OL,3,GNEWSABlue plaque in honour of Mott the
OL,4,AHoople singer
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm still a Shropshire lad at heart,"
OL,7,Fhe told fans. "I'm eternally grateful
OL,8,Ffor your love and your support - it's
OL,9,Fbeen 50 odd years, when you're 87, you
OL,10,Fdo need a little support."
